{"h": "c4724b56a4bef924", "n": "After several unfortunate mishaps with confusing signage on spacecraft, The Peel-N-StikTM Corporation teamed up with Kerland-Mutani to unveil the Semiotic Standard for Kerbal Vessels, a set of standardized icons for use on ships and stations. (Based on the work of Ron Cobb)", "s": "After several unfortunate mishaps with confusing signage on spacecraft, The Peel-N-StikTM Corporation teamed up with Kerland-Mutani to unveil the Semiotic Standard for Kerbal Vessels, a set of standardized icons for use on ships and stations. (Based on the work of Ron Cobb)", "t": "在航天器上因标识不清导致数起不幸事故后，The Peel-N-StikTM Corporation 与 Kerland-Mutani 联手推出了坎巴拉飞船符号学标准，这是一套用于飞船和空间站的标准化图标。（基于 Ron Cobb 的作品）", "mod": "ConformalDecals"}
